{"id":17072,"author":"Coco_stag","body":"\u003cb\u003eWelcome to 'What time do you wake up?'\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou can answer as many questions as you would like to.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003eWhat time do you wake up?: 5AM-7AM\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eWhat time do you wake up on a school day?: 5:30AM (Feral)\u003cbr\u003eWhat time do you go to bed?: 9:30PM-11:30PM\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eWhat time do you go to bed on a school day?: 9:30PM-10:30PM\u003cbr\u003eLatest you have stayed up to?: I remember staying up to 12AM on New Years Eve so I could witness going into 2015 but then went to bed at 3AM xD\u003cbr\u003eLatest you have slept in?: 9AM (Feral)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eNow its your go!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat time do you wake up?:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat time do you go to bed?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat time do you go to bed on a school day?:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat time do you wake up on a school day?:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eLatest you have stayed up to?:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eLatest you have slept in?:\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cb\u003eWelcome to 'What time do you wake up?'\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYou can answer as many questions as you would like to.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003eWhat time do you wake up?: 5AM-7AM\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eWhat time do you wake up on a school day?: 5:30AM (Feral)\u003cbr\u003eWhat time do you go to bed?: 9:30PM-11:30PM\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003eWhat time do you go to bed on a school day?: 9:30PM-10:30PM\u003cbr\u003eLatest you have stayed up to?: I remember staying up to 12AM on New Years Eve so I could witness going into 2015 but then went to bed at 3AM xD\u003cbr\u003eLatest you have slept in?: 9AM (Feral